9
00:00:27,619 --> 00:00:30,435
Masaniyar falsafa,
ƴar jariya, marubuciya,

10
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,235
Marubuciya, ƴan jarida...

11
00:00:32,279 --> 00:00:34,202
Beauvoir ta kasance duk wannan.

12
00:00:34,203 --> 00:00:37,104
A yau mun san ta ta
musamman saboda ta ci gaba

13
00:00:37,105 --> 00:00:41,187
